      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Order Webhook Processor\n\nReceives incoming orders via webhook, validates required fields,\nand passes valid orders to a reusable sub-workflow for processing.\n\n## Endpoint\nPOST /orders/new-order\n\n## Authentication\nHeader-based API authentication\n\n## Validation\nRequired fields:\n- order_id\n- customer_id\n- total\n\n## Main Flow\n1. Receive order via webhook\n2. Validate required fields\n3. Execute order-processing sub-workflow\n4. Return success or validation error response\n\n## Success Response\nReturns:\n- status\n- order_id\n- stored\n- stored_order\n- processed\n- processing_result\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
